{"name":"Agile Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"agile-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>An item or weapon carried by the robot is launched up to 20 feet into the air; you Interact to catch it.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#agile-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"agile-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"30258d039511f199"}
{"name":"Imitator Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"imitator-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>Focuses on a target within the first range increment or reach; your damaging Strikes against it make it @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{off-guard} until the start of your next turn.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#imitator-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"imitator-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"856c25ae775d5d86"}
{"name":"Powerful Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"powerful-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>Until the start of your next turn, your Strikes that damage creatures within the robot companion&#39;s melee reach also deal 1d6 persistent bleed damage (2d6 if burly or deft).</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#powerful-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"powerful-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"87bc6d0235fa5929"}
{"name":"Surveillance Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"surveillance-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>Until the end of your next turn, creatures adjacent to the robot can’t flank you or make you @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{off-guard}.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#surveillance-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"surveillance-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"489a73fded65ca9c"}
{"name":"Tank Chassis: Support","type":"action","img":"icons/svg/target.svg","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"slug":"tank-chassis-support","actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","publication":{"title":"Tech Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"description":{"value":"<p>Gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your next Strike against a foe within the robot’s melee reach; it ends after the Strike or at the start of your next turn.</p><p>@Localize[SFMTP.ManualActionHint]</p><p><a href=\"https://2e.aonsrd.com/companions/all#tank-chassis\">Archives of Nethys · Tech Core, p. 73</a></p>"},"rules":[],"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[],"otherTags":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e-missing-tech-pets":{"moduleProvided":true,"chassisId":"tank-chassis","itemKind":"robot-support"}},"_id":"f525670c9703a05c"}
